  "id": "social-ecology",
  "term": "social ecology",
  "definition": "Social ecology is a social theory that explains well-being in relation to the social environment, while emphasizing that this link depends on social behavior. In this view, how people perceive their social surroundings affects subjective well-being through the way they interact socially.",
